<div class="page-head"><div class="titles"><h1>Move your ERP opening position</h1><p class="page-sub">Bring products, variants, locations, physical stock, open orders and opening books into a new inventory. Review the source before approving any business changes.</p></div></div>
<% if(locals.migrationAllowed===false){ %><section class="card section" data-agent-plan-locked><div class="card-body"><span class="badge">Growth</span><h2>Move data from another ERP</h2><p>Prepared ERP migrations require Growth or above. Saved progress stays available for review.</p><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/settings/billing">Upgrade plan</a><a class="btn" href="/imports">Back to imports</a></div></section><% }else{ %>
<div class="card section" id="old-system"><div class="card-body"><h2>Move your data from your old system</h2><p>Choose the CSV or Excel exports from your old system: products, stock on hand with its value, suppliers, customers, open purchase and sales orders, unpaid invoices and bills, and the export’s totals. StockChief checks every total before anything is saved.</p>
<form method="post" action="/erp-cutovers/old-system" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="stack-form" data-old-system-upload><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
<label class="field"><span class="field-label">Export files</span><input class="input" type="file" name="exports" multiple required accept=".csv,.tsv,.txt,.xlsx,.xls,.xlsm"></label>
<label class="field"><span class="field-label">Currency of your old books</span><input class="input" name="currency" maxlength="3" value="<%= locals.migrationCurrency||'' %>" placeholder="USD" required></label>
<label class="field"><span class="field-label">Opening balances are for</span><input class="input" type="date" name="startDate" required value="<%= new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10) %>"></label>
<label class="field"><span class="field-label">Location for stock with no location</span><input class="input" name="defaultLocation" maxlength="120" value="Main warehouse"></label>
<details><summary>Totals from your old system’s report (if the export does not include them)</summary>
<label class="field"><span class="field-label">Stock value</span><input class="input" name="stockValue" inputmode="decimal"></label>
<label class="field"><span class="field-label">Stock units</span><input class="input" name="stockUnits" inputmode="decimal"></label>
<label class="field"><span class="field-label">Customers owe</span><input class="input" name="receivables" inputmode="decimal"></label>
<label class="field"><span class="field-label">Owed to suppliers</span><input class="input" name="payables" inputmode="decimal"></label></details>
<label class="field"><span><input type="checkbox" name="sourceStopped" value="yes" required> These exports are final and I keep the old system frozen until this inventory opens.</span></label>
<button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Read my exports</button></form></div></div>
<div class="card section"><div class="card-body"><h2>Upload a prepared ERP export</h2><p>Choose a StockChief ERP export (.ndjson). Large files are sent in small pages and can resume after an interruption by choosing the same file again. Keep your source ERP frozen until the balances have been checked and you open this inventory.</p><form method="post" action="/erp-cutovers" data-erp-upload><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label class="field"><span class="field-label">Prepared ERP export</span><input class="input" type="file" accept=".ndjson,.jsonl" required></label><label class="field"><span><input type="checkbox" required> This is an immutable export and I will keep the old ERP frozen during the cutover.</span></label><button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Check this export</button><p role="status" data-erp-upload-status></p><a class="btn" data-erp-upgrade href="/settings/billing" hidden>Upgrade plan</a></form><p>Plan limits apply to the full cutover. No AI credits are used to upload, apply or reconcile a prepared export.</p></div></div>
<% } %><div class="card section"><div class="card-body"><h2>Saved cutovers</h2><% if(!packages.length){ %><p>No ERP cutovers yet.</p><% } %><% for(const p of packages){ %><p><a href="/erp-cutovers/<%= encodeURIComponent(p.id) %>"><%= p.source_label %></a> — <%= labels[p.status]||'Needs review' %>; <%= Number(p.staged_count).toLocaleString() %> source records</p><% } %></div></div><a class="btn" href="/imports">Back to imports</a>

<script src="/erp-cutovers.js" defer></script>
